## Simple. Transparent. Fast.
How your civic report travels from your phone to a resolved ticket.

##### Report
Snap a photo and geolocate the issue instantly.

##### Assign
Algorithms route your ticket to the exact dept.

##### Resolve
Field officers are deployed to physically fix it.

##### Complete
You receive live notifications with proof.

## Features

#### GPS Location
Auto-capture your location to ensure issues are reported from within Anand city.

#### Photo Evidence
Upload before/after photos as proof of the issue and its resolution.

#### Real-Time Tracking
Track your complaint status from submission to resolution.

#### Verified System
Smart validation ensures only legitimate issues within Anand are accepted.

#### Notifications
Get notified at every step - when submitted, assigned, in progress, and resolved.

#### Reopen Feature
Not satisfied with the resolution? Reopen the complaint for re-review.

